* news_process v3.2.0 — Data prep (plan v14 §9.2)
*
* 加载 stage 46 .dta + xtset + winsor + apply labels.
* Main spec choices: locus={{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}} subst={{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}} sent={{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}

version 19
clear all
set maxvar 32767

* 1. 加载面板 .dta
* M2 fix (2026-05-30): 优先加载 full (含 aux-only 的稳健性情感变量), 使保存的
* _prepared_panel.dta 让下游稳健性表真正运行, 而非经 `capture confirm` 静默跳过
* 整块回归 (主表 Table2 仅用 core 列, 不受影响)。
* remove-title-track: 原 _title 轨稳健性 (25_tableA8 / llm_vote_tone_title /
* tone_gap_title_full) 已取消, 不再加载/回归。
* 注: 21_tableA2 现已改读本 _prepared_panel.dta (2026-05-30 fix + set maxvar 32767),
* 故 master 链的 22_tableA3 Bartik lf/lc-IV 在其 in-memory full 状态上可正常 run (不再静默跳过)。
* CLAUDE.md: 本机 MP (set maxvar 32767) 应直读 full; 仅 IC 协作者回退 core+aux merge。
capture confirm file "data/processed/46_panel_yearly_full.dta"
if !_rc {
    use "data/processed/46_panel_yearly_full.dta", clear
}
else {
    use "data/processed/46_panel_yearly_core.dta", clear
    capture merge 1:1 target_bank year using "data/processed/46_panel_yearly_aux.dta", nogen
}
display "  Loaded: `=_N' bank-year obs × `=c(k)' variables"

* 2. 加载 variable + value labels
capture do "data/processed/46_panel_yearly_labels.do"

* 3. 主键编码 + xtset
capture confirm variable bank_id
if _rc {
    encode target_bank, gen(bank_id)
}
xtset bank_id year

* 4. Winsor 关键连续变量 (1% / 99%, Loughran & McDonald 2011 JF 惯例)
local main_dv      llm_vote_tone_{{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}
local main_locus   tech_frac_{{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}}
local main_subst   symb_frac_{{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}}

* 4.bis (R1-R5 audit fix A1 + M2-regression fix 2026-05-30): 定义 $bank_controls 全局 macro
* 供 19_*_clarity_robustness 等下游稳健性模板使用 (remove-title-track: 25_tableA8 已删)。
* 银行财务控制 (ln_assets/leverage/...) 需 Wind/CSMAR merge, 当前 dev 面板尚未含。
* 若 $bank_controls 硬列入不存在的变量, `reghdfe DV ... $bank_controls` 会 r(111)
* 硬崩溃 (从静默跳过恶化为中断)。
* 自校验: 逐个 capture confirm, 只把面板中实际存在的财务控制拼入 $bank_controls。
local _bc ""
foreach v in ln_assets leverage capital_ratio npl_ratio deposit_growth {
    capture confirm variable `v'
    if !_rc {
        local _bc "`_bc' `v'"
    }
}
global bank_controls "`_bc'"
display "  bank_controls = [$bank_controls] (仅面板中存在的财务控制; 缺失项需 Wind/CSMAR merge)"

* 检查 winsor2 是否可用 (ssc install winsor2)
capture which winsor2
if !_rc {
    foreach var of varlist `main_dv' `main_locus' `main_subst' {
        capture confirm variable `var'
        if !_rc {
            winsor2 `var', cuts(1 99) replace
        }
    }
    display "  ✅ Winsorized 1%/99% on main DV + LOCUS + SUBST"

    * v3.5.1 A1+A3: winsorize 8 新列 (per plan v0.3 §2.5.3 修 M4' guard).
    * `capture confirm variable` guard 保证不引用 A1/A3 的 paper 跳过, 不抛错.
    * 同 winsor 阈值 1%/99% (Loughran-McDonald 2011 JF 惯例) + Hales 2011 CAR 量化披露
    * 饱和度 fallback (修 R7-M1 + R8-M4 num_intensity / clarity 同 winsorize).
    foreach v3_5_1_var in mean_clarity_score_full mean_clarity_score_ctx ///
                          mean_frac_definite_full mean_frac_definite_ctx ///
                          frac_amb_articles_full frac_amb_articles_ctx ///
                          mean_num_intensity_full mean_num_intensity_ctx {
        capture confirm variable `v3_5_1_var'
        if !_rc {
            winsor2 `v3_5_1_var', cuts(1 99) replace
        }
    }
    display "  ✅ v3.5.1: A1+A3 8 cols winsorized (graceful via capture confirm)"
}
else {
    display "  ⚠️ winsor2 not installed (ssc install winsor2); skip winsorization"
}

* 5. 派生交互项 (主回归用)
capture confirm variable digital_frontier
if !_rc {
    gen byte _has_df = !missing(digital_frontier)
    display "  digital_frontier 非缺失: `=_has_df'/`=_N' bank-year"
    drop _has_df
}

* 6. (R1-R5 audit fix A3): 保存 _prepared_panel.dta 供下游稳健性模板
* (19_*_clarity_robustness 等) 使用. 此前在主线 run 链下 file-not-found, 因主线
* 01_data_prep 加载 core.dta 后无 save。(remove-title-track: 原 25_tableA8/26_bs
* 标题轨表已删, 不再是消费方。)
capture mkdir "data/processed"
if "$data_dir" == "" {
    save "data/processed/_prepared_panel.dta", replace
}
else {
    save "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", replace
}

display "✅ Data prep done. Ready for tables."
